-- Lite 3.13.0 store (schema v81): its DDL, two rows per table and one per archive file, captured from a store 3.13.0's own
-- DuckDbInitializer, ArchiveService and RetentionService built. {ARCHIVE} is the archive folder, {MONTH} an archive month
-- (yyyyMM), {DAY} an archive day (yyyyMMdd), and {T:n} a timestamp n seconds from the test clock. Its views are 3.13.0's, rebuilt by the climb.
